            <title>[IGNITE-4724] AVG function always returns double type instead of the argument type</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4724</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;For H2:&lt;br/&gt;
SELECT AVG(intCol) FROM cache_part_2 AS part_2 WHERE (10*shortCol/100) &amp;gt; longCol&lt;br/&gt;
-&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;472&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For Ignite:&lt;br/&gt;
