                            <comment id="16019921" author="skalashnikov" created="Mon, 22 May 2017 18:00:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented fix. Tests are in progress.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16020971" author="skalashnikov" created="Tue, 23 May 2017 09:54:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;TC is OK. Patch is available for review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16026277" author="vozerov" created="Fri, 26 May 2017 13:22:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=skalashnikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;skalashnikov&quot;&gt;skalashnikov&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br/&gt;
Looks like we need more test here with different numeric datatypes, to make sure that final conversion is always correct. For now I see only tests for &lt;tt&gt;Integer&lt;/tt&gt; and some fractional types. Full list to check:&lt;br/&gt;
1) &lt;tt&gt;TINYINT&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;java.lang.Byte&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
2) &lt;tt&gt;SMALLINT&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;java.lang.Short&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
3) &lt;tt&gt;INT&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;INTEGER&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;MEDIUMINT&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;java.lang.Integer&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
4) &lt;tt&gt;BIGINT&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;java.lang.Long&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
5) &lt;tt&gt;DECIMAL&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;java.lang.BigDecimal&lt;/tt&gt; with proper precision/scale&lt;br/&gt;
6) &lt;tt&gt;REAL&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;java.lang.Float&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
7) &lt;tt&gt;DOUBLE&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;FLOAT&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;java.lang.Double&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
